11
00:59:07,500 --> 00:59:13,500
Low Tide is a 2019 American drama film, written and directed by Kevin McMullin.

12
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
It stars Keean Johnson, Alex Neustaedter, Daniel Zolghadri,
Kristine Froseth, Shea Whigham, and Jaeden Martell.

13
01:09:52,500 --> 01:09:58,500
It had its world premiere at the Tribeca Film Festival on April 28, 2019 and was theatrically released in
the United States on October 4, 2019, by A24 and released internationally by DirecTV Cinema.

14
01:15:15,000 --> 01:15:21,000
